#. Tag: para
#: man-preparetips.1.docbook:47
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>preparetips</command> is a script to extract the text from a tips "
"file. It outputs the text so <command>xgettext</command> can add the tips to "
"a PO file. PO files provide a human-readable string format used for "
"translations."
msgstr ""
"<command>preparetips</command> je skripta za izvloačenje teksta iz dokumenta "
"sa uputama.Na izlazu da je tekst tako da<command>xgettext</command> može "
"dodati upute u Po-dokument.PO dokumenti obezbjeđuje da format stringa "
"korišten u prevodima bude čitljiv."

#. Tag: para
#: man-preparetips.1.docbook:51
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>preparetips</command> looks for <emphasis role=\"underline\">data/"
"tips-en</emphasis> as tips file."
msgstr ""
"<command>pripremi upute</command> traži  <emphasis role=\"underline\">data/"
"tips-en</emphasis> kao dokument sa uputama."

